ources disagree, the latest decision wins (later mail/meeting decision/correction beats earlier analysis; old IVR script, FAQ web page, outdated drawing are not policy where later decision says otherwise). Keep the exact sentences the documents give for the agent to say, verbatim in original language. Include: call variables, tool call details/error statuses and what to say, every branch, transfers, global handling (person request, silence, out of scope, language, anger), test customers table summary (customer ids and expected behaviour). Be fast: finish within 6 minutes. Reply with just \"done\".","outputFile":"C:\\Users\\Burak\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\claude\\C--Users-Burak-Desktop-Projects-agent-builder--claude-worktrees-final-case--builder-agentic-final8\\adf52405-6942-4d44-9d85-c3233da23ca1\\tasks\\a25cda178a77b041d.output","canReadOutputFile":true}}
