{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01XaZnugf2jdGHxzEsFQWRQE","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Freya Bank: credit card statement debt\n2\t\n3\tThis folder is the final case. The task is in `BRIEF.md`.\n4\t\n5\tFreya Bank is fictional. Every customer, card, amount, address and person in this folder is made up.\n6\t\n7\t## What is here\n8\t\n9\t- `statement-debt-call-flow.pdf`: a call-flow drawing of the step.\n10\t- `sources/emails/`: mail threads between Freya Bank and our team. The bank's analysis documents are in `sources/emails/attachments/`.\n11\t- `sources/documents/`: what the bank handed over: the phone-menu prompt sheet, the service contract and a page from the bank's website.\n12\t- `sources/meetings/`: transcript excerpts from meetings with the bank.\n13\t- `test-environment/`: the test customers your mock serves (`test-customers.json`, and the same data as a table in `test-customers.md`).\n14\t- `example-scenarios.md`: six example calls of the kind we score with.\n15\t- `cloudflare-mock/`: how to deploy a Cloudflare Worker, with a one-endpoint example.\n16\t\n17\tThe sources were written at different times by different people. They do not always agree.\n18\t\n19\t## The two call variables\n20\t\n21\tEvery call reaches the assistant with:\n22\t\n23\t- `customerNumber`: the 8-digit customer number. The phone menu has already identified the caller.\n24\t- `now`: the date and time of the call, Istanbul time, e.g. `2026-10-12T10:30:00+03:00`.\n25\t\n26\tThe calls are in Turkish."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01S2HeanQ121N3iUrzXcmepZ","session_id":"adf52405-6942-4d44-9d85-c3233da23ca1","uuid":"e214d88b-4004-40fc-8f70-743d61344a21","timestamp":"2026-10-11T19:19:32.582Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Write rules.md from docs"}
